  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for a top-tier university with a strong focus on innovation and research? Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI) in Troy, New York, is a great fit. Rensselaer, New York, is consistently ranked among the top universities in the United States, particularly in STEM fields. Moreover, the courses at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute span across undergraduate and postgraduate programmes in Engineering, Business, Architecture, Science, and Humanities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>With a vibrant student community and over 200 student clubs and organisations, RPI gives you countless opportunities. The Student Government and Rensselaer Union provide essential services for you, including event planning and resources for your academic and personal well-being.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute’s accommodation includes various on-campus options, including 22 residence halls and Greek housing, as well as off-campus ones. Most first-year students reside in freshman-only residence halls, while sophomores have the option to choose between campus and Greek housing.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The Folsom Library is RPI’s main hub for academic resources, offering an extensive collection of books, journals, and digital materials. Whether you're in need of quiet study spaces or collaborative areas, the library provides the right atmosphere.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>RPI offers a wide variety of sports, including varsity teams, intramurals, and fitness programmes. You can be part of the Houston Field House, home to RPI’s hockey team. You can also access the robust East Campus Athletic Village, which includes state-of-the-art gym facilities, an Olympic-sized pool, and a track and field complex.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>At RPI, you’ll find cutting-edge laboratories for Engineering, Computer Science, Biomedical Science, and Artificial Intelligence.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>Whether you're grabbing a quick bite at the Commons Dining Hall or enjoying a sit-down meal at The Bistro, you'll find many eating spaces on campus. You can also visit the Rathskeller, RPI’s student-run pub.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
